    "trail_note": "Park near a gate at the start of an unmarked side road off the Forestry Trunk Road (940), 2.3 km east of the Red Deer Ranger station. A logging road climbs about halfway, then a narrower maintenance track leads to the top. The route guide calls the trail an old closed fire road."
